rnament."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk to someone in a restaurant. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "take a year off "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "stop studying for one year"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Vanessa's trip makes me want to take a year off and travel."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "salad "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a variety of vegetables or fruit mixed together"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I would prefer to order a salad."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob05aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bacon "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a type of meat (from a pig) prepared in long thin strips "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  We have pepperoni cheese pizzas with bacon."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "mango "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a tropical orange-colored fruit "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Would you like a mango salad?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cucumber"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a long vegetable, white on the inside with a green skin "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  The mango salad with cucumbers is amazing."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob05aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "conten